# Pytest Collection Audit Readiness

RULE: Before claiming "tests pass", run `cd <repo> && uv run pytest --collect-only -q`. Collection must complete with zero errors.
WHY: Import errors, missing path deps, and broken fixtures surface at collection time.
CODEX: 06-coding-standards/testing.md, 06-coding-standards/quality-gates.md

DO: Run `pytest --collect-only -q` before asserting tests pass; install path deps in workspace venv when tests import sibling libs
NEVER: Claim "tests pass" without collection verification; use deprecated `unified_api_contracts.sports` or `unified_api_contracts.internal` (use `unified_internal_contracts`)

Import paths: Internal schemas → `unified_internal_contracts`; sports → `unified_api_contracts_external.sports`. See contracts-integration.mdc.
